-- ===========================================================================
-- PlayerbotV2 - SHARED DATABASE SEED DATA
-- ===========================================================================
-- Companion to playerbot_shared_schema.sql. Apply the schema FIRST.
--
--   mysql -u<user> -p playerbot < playerbot_shared_data.sql
--
-- Contains no USE statement, so it works whatever you named the schema.
--
-- STATIC CONTENT ONLY. Every row here is realm-independent: map-derived nav
-- data, generation templates, distribution tables and the bot name pool.
-- No realm state is shipped - nothing references a character GUID or an
-- account id, so this file is safe to load on any realm.
--
-- In particular the name pool ships PRISTINE: is_taken, is_used and
-- used_by_guid are reset on all 107,339 rows. Name usage is realm-scoped
-- (a name taken on one realm says nothing about another), so the live
-- servers usage flags are deliberately NOT exported.
--
-- TABLE ORDER IS SIGNIFICANT: playerbot_spec_info must be populated before
-- playerbot_bot_templates, whose BEFORE INSERT/UPDATE triggers validate
-- spec_id against it. Do not reorder.
-- ===========================================================================

